# .easignore — files EXCLUDED from the EAS Build upload archive.
#
# When this file exists, EAS uses it INSTEAD of .gitignore for the archive, so it
# must list everything to omit. Dependencies and build artifacts are regenerated
# on the EAS servers (npm install + prebuild), so they never need uploading — the
# previous upload was 221 MB purely because node_modules (323 MB) was included.
#
# NOTE: this is a managed Expo app (no android/ios dirs — prebuild runs in the
# cloud). If you ever commit custom native android/ios dirs, do NOT ignore them.

# dependencies — installed fresh on EAS
node_modules/

# Expo / JS build artifacts (regenerated)
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
expo-env.d.ts

# credentials / secrets — must never leave the machine
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision

# logs / debug
*.log
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*
.metro-health-check*

# VCS + OS cruft
.git/
.DS_Store
